  "id": "consistent-mapping",
  "term": "consistent mapping",
  "definition": "Consistent mapping is a task arrangement in which a given stimulus always requires the same response over time. In cognitive tasks, this stable stimulus-response relationship is linked to marked performance improvement after relatively brief practice.",
